# WP-LANDSCAPE-SPLINES (UE 5.5: ALandscapeSplineActor - one spatially loaded actor per spline in a World Partition
# world, ULandscapeSplinesComponent on it, ULandscapeInfo::MoveSplinesToLevel; USplineMeshComponents in the cell HLOD).
# Every landscape spline is its own entity (LandscapeSpline block: Landscape = the root by id, an observation like
# LandscapeTile.Landscape; Splines = control points + segments, world cm). Its footprint is its band's box (control
# points' Width + SideFalloff + EndFalloff, the curve sampled) and NOT the entity position, so a 1 km road goes to the
# grid level whose cell is at least 1 km wide (Rules::PlanWorldPartition, "a wide composite goes up a level").
# The cell HLOD of the spline's cell carries its bent spline meshes (HLODExclusion::LandscapeSpline answered by the
# LandscapeSpline HLOD builder, a world-space EditMesh like the landscape tile's), so the road stays to the horizon.
# Expected log lines (editor.log "[WorldPartition] 'WP_Protocol': ..."): the spline entity's composite on level L>=2
# ("level <L> (footprint ~100000 cm)"), the WP debug view shows the far spline cells not resident near the player.
# The world: WP_Protocol (partitioned, its landscape loaded by Load All). The road is authored here with the
# Landscape Splines tool, five control points 250 m apart along X from -40000 to 60000 (a 1 km road), and saved before
# Build HLODs; the sweep restores Content afterwards. Expected: the spline's composite on a level whose cell holds
# ~100000 cm ("level <L> (footprint ~100000 cm)", L >= 2).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Дано run Landscape "Sculpt mode"
Дано run Landscape "Tool: Splines"
Дано run Landscape "Spline mesh: engine Cube slab 400 x 20 cm"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.001,-1,0.001
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -40000,9000,0
Дано run Landscape "Spline: add control point at viewport centre"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -15000,9000,0
Дано run Landscape "Spline: add control point at viewport centre"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 10000,9000,0
Дано run Landscape "Spline: add control point at viewport centre"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 35000,9000,0
Дано run Landscape "Spline: add control point at viewport centre"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 60000,9000,0
Дано run Landscape "Spline: add control point at viewport centre"
Дано run Landscape "Spline: deselect"
Дано run Mode "Select mode"
Дано run Action "Save Scene"
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано wait-idle 2400
Дано run Mode "Select mode"
Дано run Action "Play"
Дано advance 2
# In Play the viewport camera is the player's: the player (9000001, the streaming source) is moved to the road's near end.
Дано select 9000001
Дано --subject selection set Translation -39000,1500,0
Дано advance 2
Тогда splines_near дорога вблизи лежит на месте (меши сплайна на земле, полоса сплайна в высотах и краске), без дыр; отладка WP: ячейки дальнего конца дороги не резидентны (сущность сплайна - одна, её ячейка верхнего уровня; дальние сплайны других ячеек не загружены); лог: композит LandscapeSpline на уровне >= 2
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -39000,100000,0
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 1,-0.35,0
Когда advance 2
Тогда splines_far_hlod дорога видна до горизонта в HLOD (изогнутые меши сплайна в HLOD ячейки, рядом с HLOD ландшафта), без обрыва на границе ячеек и без провала между ближней дорогой и её HLOD
Когда run Action "Stop"
# Restore: Stop rebuilds the scene from the Play snapshot; nothing above was saved.
